        "raw": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Hey, guys!</p><p>My wife started a job at the Boonshoft Museum of Discovery in Dayton this past November and has been assisting with their educational programs (including the Museum&#39;s &quot;Harry Potter&quot; science camp, which just ended last week). &nbsp;This month, Boonshoft is hosting their first ever GeekFest, held at the museum itself, on Friday, July 17th, from 6pm-11pm.</p><p>Events will include an open board gaming room (being run by my wife and I), a Super Smash Brothers tournament, a costume contest, Geek Jeopardy, planetarium shows (and open retro gaming on the planetarium dome!), and several other events. &nbsp;I&#39;ll actually be demoing a new board game prototype that I just finished drafting. &nbsp;Vendors will include several notable Dayton-area game/comics stores, who have also offered prize support for the various events.</p><p>Admission is $10 at the door, which benefits the museum&#39;s astronomy programs and educational outreach.</p><p>More information is available here: &nbsp;<a href=\"https://boonshoftblog.wordpress.com/2015/06/25/were-getting-our-geek-on-how-about-you/\">Boonshoft Museum of Discovery--Geekfest 2015</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
